## The Parlour

@narrator{code="0010"}: Six cups, six saucers, five spoons.
@aunt_mabel{code="0010"}: The Hollin spoon is gone. My grandmother's spoon!
@vicar{code="0010"}: Perhaps it simply wandered off, Mabel.

<branch id="firstLook" prompt="Where do you look first?">
  <choice id="sugarBowl" text="Look in the sugar bowl">
    @pippa{code="0010"}: Nothing but lumps.
  </choice>
  <choice id="vicarPocket" text="Glance at the vicar's pocket" into="run.sawPocket">
